        <div class="kicker"><span class="dot"></span> Coming soon</div>
        <h1>Verified local journalism, from the source.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Here News (Hona | هنا) is a global digital platform in development where independent journalists publish verified,
          location-based stories — and get paid for their work.
        </p>

        <div class="pills" aria-label="Core themes">
          <span class="pill">Verified reporting</span>
          <span class="pill">Geo-tagged stories</span>
          <span class="pill">Fair pay for journalists</span>
          <span class="pill">Trust & reputation system</span>
          <span class="pill">Local-first discovery</span>
        </div>

        <div class="hr"></div>


        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card col-8">
            <h2>What is Here News?</h2>
            <p>
              Here News is designed for independent journalism — local reporters, citizen journalists, photographers,
              and videographers who witness events and can report with proof.
            </p>
            <p>
              Readers (and partner outlets) get authentic, real-time local stories from across the world — with a way to
              support journalists directly.
            </p>
            <p class="small">
              Think of it as a blend of <strong>Associated Press</strong> + <strong>Uber</strong> + <strong>Patreon</strong> —
              built for modern, decentralized reporting.
            </p>
          </div>

          <aside class="card col-4">
            <h2>How it works</h2>
            <ul style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0; padding-left: 18px;">
              <li>Journalists publish geo-tagged stories with media proof.</li>
              <li>Contributor profiles build reputation through verification and peer validation.</li>
              <li>Optional AI-assisted checks flag inconsistencies or plagiarism.</li>
              <li>Readers can support reporters directly; outlets can license exclusives.</li>
            </ul>
          </aside>

          <div class="card col-6">
            <h2>Mission</h2>
            <p>
              Build a trusted global platform that elevates local voices, protects credibility in reporting,
              and enables sustainable income for independent journalists.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card col-6">
            <h2>Vision</h2>
            <p>
              A world where real-time local journalism is easier to verify, easier to discover, and fairer to the people who create it —
              while restoring public trust in what is true.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card col-12">
            <h2>Coming soon, built responsibly</h2>
            <p>
              Here News is currently in the research and early development phase. The focus is on defining verification standards,
              designing a fair payout model, and preparing pilot regions with a small group of trusted contributors.
            </p>
            <p class="small notice">
              Early supporters help fund development, verification workflows, and pilot testing — without compromising independence.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card col-12">
            <h2>Our first flagship initiative</h2>
            <p>
              Alongside Here News, we are developing a specialized initiative focused on scientific knowledge in Arabic:
              the <strong>Scientific News Channel Project</strong>. It applies the same principles of integrity, verification,
              and respect for original sources — to science and heritage.
            </p>
            <div class="btn-row">
              <a class="btn primary" href="/project.html">Explore the Scientific Project</a>
              <a class="btn ghost" href="/about.html">About Ali Gamal</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
